  bug: ['Facet counts off by one after filtering', 'Empty results for quoted phrases', 'Highlighting breaks on emoji', 'Pagination repeats the last item', 'Autocomplete flicker in Safari', 'Wrong currency in price facet', 'Stale index after bulk import', 'Crash on two-letter queries', 'Price sort ignores discounts', 'Locale fallback returns English', 'Duplicate suggestions for plurals', 'Back button loses filters'],
